er Claim Appraiser","url":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-services-nebraska/homeowner-claim-appraiser/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Commercial & HOA Claim Appraisal","url":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-services-nebraska/commercial-hoa-claim-appraisal/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Hail & Roof Appraisal","url":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-services-nebraska/hail-roof-appraisal/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Tornado & Straight-Line Wind Appraisal","url":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-services-nebraska/tornado-straight-line-wind-appraisal/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Farm & Ranch Outbuilding Appraisal","url":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-services-nebraska/farm-ranch-outbuilding-appraisal/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Water Damage Claim Appraisal","url":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-services-nebraska/water-damage-claim-appraisal/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Fire & Smoke Damage Appraisal","url":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-services-nebraska/fire-smoke-damage-appraisal/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Ice Dam & Frozen Pipe Appraisal","url":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-services-nebraska/ice-dam-frozen-pipe-appraisal/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Carrier Estimate Review","url":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-services-nebraska/carrier-estimate-review/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Umpire Selection & Services","url":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-services-nebraska/umpire-selection-services/"}}]},"knowsAbout":["Insurance appraisal","Appraisal clause","Hail damage","Wind damage","Farm building claims","Property claim valuation"],"openingHoursSpecification":[{"@type":"OpeningHoursSpecification","dayOfWeek":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday"],"opens":"08:00","closes":"18:00"}]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/#website","url":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/","name":"Nebraska Insurance Appraiser","publisher":{"@id":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/#business"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/questions-about-appraisal/#webpage","url":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/questions-about-appraisal/","name":"Insurance Appraisal FAQ | Nebraska Claim Questions","description":"Answers to common Nebraska insurance appraisal questions, grouped by topic: basics, costs, timing, state specifics and working with us.","inLanguage":"en-US","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/#website"},"about":{"@id":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/#business"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/#business"},"dateModified":"2026-11-14","breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/questions-about-appraisal/#breadcrumb"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@id":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/questions-about-appraisal/#primaryimage"},"mainEntity":{"@id":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/questions-about-appraisal/#faq"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/questions-about-appraisal/#primaryimage","url":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp","contentUrl":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp","width":960,"height":640,"caption":"Two women talking across a table in a bright office"},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Questions about appraisal","item":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/questions-about-appraisal/"}],"@id":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/questions-about-appraisal/#breadcrumb"},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is insurance appraisal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A process in most property policies for resolving disputes about the amount of loss. Each side names an appraiser, the appraisers choose an umpire, and two of the three signing an award sets the amount."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is appraisal the same as arbitration?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Appraisal is narrower. It values the loss and does not decide coverage or legal claims."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who can demand appraisal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Usually either the policyholder or the insurer, by written demand, if the policy contains an appraisal clause."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does appraisal decide whether damage is covered?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Coverage is decided by the carrier and, if necessary, a court. Appraisal values covered damage."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does an appraiser cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Fees vary. Some appraisers charge a flat fee, some hourly and some a percentage of the increase. We put our fee in writing before work starts."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who pays the umpire?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most policies split the umpire’s fee equally between you and the insurer."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the first conversation free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We review your situation at no cost and tell you whether appraisal is likely to make sense."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can fees be more than the recovery?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"On a small gap, yes. That is why we recommend running the numbers first."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does appraisal take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Often six to ten weeks for a simple residential claim once both appraisers are named. Larger claims take longer."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a deadline to demand appraisal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Some policies set one; many tie it to other conditions. Read your policy and watch the suit-limitation period."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How soon must I report hail damage?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Policies require prompt notice and some set a specific window for wind and hail. Report as soon as you reasonably can."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What if my policy deadline is close?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Talk to a Nebraska attorney right away. Appraisal does not necessarily stop the clock on a lawsuit deadline."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who regulates insurers in Nebraska?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Nebraska Department of Insurance in Lincoln. It accepts consumer complaints and oversees claim practices."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Nebraska have a FAIR plan or wind pool?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"There is no coastal wind pool, and as of this writing Nebraska is not among the states with a FAIR plan. Ask the Department of Insurance about current options if you are nonrenewed."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are percentage hail deductibles common here?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Many Nebraska homeowners policies apply a wind/hail deductible as a percentage of the dwelling limit."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What about bad faith?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Nebraska law addresses unfair claim practices and recognizes bad-faith claims in some circumstances. That is a legal matter for an attorney, not an appraiser."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are you public adjusters or attorneys?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Neither. We provide appraisal, estimating and umpire services. We do not give legal advice or negotiate claims outside appraisal."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you serve all of Nebraska?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, all 93 counties, from Omaha and Lincoln to the Sandhills and the Panhandle."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What should I send for a review?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Your declarations page, the carrier’s full estimate, any letters, photos and your contractor’s estimate if you have one."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you guarantee results?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No honest appraiser can. We give you a candid assessment and a defensible valuation."}}],"@id":"https://nebraskainsuranceappraiser.com/questions-about-appraisal/#faq"}]}</script>
